1
00:00:00,860 --> 00:00:01,990
MAN:
May I help you?

2
00:00:01,996 --> 00:00:03,026
(Sheldon:)Um...

3
00:00:03,030 --> 00:00:05,200
(Leonard:)Uh, uh... we don't
have an appointment,

4
00:00:05,199 --> 00:00:06,529
and-and we don't
belong here,

5
00:00:06,534 --> 00:00:08,864
but we-we're, like,
crazy-big fans.

6
00:00:08,869 --> 00:00:10,539
(Penny:)I mean...
(stammers)

7
00:00:10,538 --> 00:00:12,538
"crazy for Star
Wars" crazy,

8
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:15,540
(Leonard:)not crazy like we have a
backpack full of duct tape,

9
00:00:15,543 --> 00:00:16,873
(Leonard:)although we do
have a backpack

10
00:00:16,877 --> 00:00:18,947
(Leonard:)that you really don't
want to look in.

11
00:00:21,881 --> 00:00:23,211
(Sheldon:)You're blowing it.

12
00:00:23,217 --> 00:00:24,887
(Sheldon:)We want to meet
George Lucas

13
00:00:24,885 --> 00:00:27,285
(Sheldon:)and become his friends
and play with him!

14
00:00:29,823 --> 00:00:31,153
(Voice:)Hello?

15
00:00:31,158 --> 00:00:32,888
(Voice:)This speaker's not working,
just pull up.

16
00:00:37,664 --> 00:00:39,534
(Leonard:)And that's how it's done.

17
00:00:48,575 --> 00:00:52,575
(Sheldon:)All right, we've defeated
the first challenge.

18
00:00:54,080 --> 00:00:56,750
(Sheldon:)Now we must steel ourselves
to face the monster

19
00:00:56,751 --> 00:00:59,021
(Sheldon:)who defends the gate.

